WEBVTT

00:15.680 --> 00:17.080
No target in sight!

00:33.700 --> 00:35.130
Bloody hell!

00:39.790 --> 00:41.890
Alpha Company, no response.

00:50.130 --> 00:52.570
This is Vanguard 1. Nothing on infrared.

00:52.570 --> 00:53.720
No survivors!

01:00.280 --> 01:01.970
Vanguard 1 is down!

01:01.970 --> 01:03.450
The Vatican?

01:03.450 --> 01:07.040
Why are the forbidden ones being dispatched to England?

01:07.040 --> 01:09.920
At Her Majesty's discretion.

01:10.190 --> 01:12.190
The operation is already in motion.

01:20.370 --> 01:21.600
The Anti-Creed...

01:22.100 --> 01:23.540
of Fatima.

01:37.160 --> 01:39.570
The Gate of Caelum is open.

01:39.570 --> 01:40.700
Can you see it?

01:40.700 --> 01:41.700
Yes.

01:41.700 --> 01:44.080
Then, just as I arranged...

01:44.450 --> 01:47.290
System halt. Status: unconfined.

01:51.920 --> 01:52.710
Come!

02:02.600 --> 02:03.680
Divine Union!

02:22.160 --> 02:23.790
Nights...

02:23.790 --> 02:26.750
It doesn't matter what you are, you'll always...

02:31.080 --> 02:33.500
Dimensional transformation: level 5.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.510
...my enemy!

03:03.990 --> 03:05.990
You restrained yourself well.

03:06.620 --> 03:09.000
Allow me to defeat the next one.

03:09.000 --> 03:13.210
As soon as we know their objective,
you may do as you wish.

03:14.590 --> 03:17.210
And I'll let you have your revenge.

03:17.960 --> 03:18.010
{Part A}

03:23.810 --> 03:26.440
Tenman
Shrine

03:28.400 --> 03:30.360
Tenman

03:28.400 --> 03:30.360
Shrine

03:30.350 --> 03:32.600
Takkyun, whatcha wish for?

03:30.360 --> 03:32.610
Fortunes

03:32.600 --> 03:35.570
As if you don't know!

03:32.610 --> 03:36.530
Win your love!

03:35.570 --> 03:36.520
Kill me.

03:36.530 --> 03:37.990
Stag Beetle

03:36.530 --> 03:37.990
It's hot

03:37.980 --> 03:40.450
Excellent luck! It says,
"Someone nearby is in love with you!"

03:37.990 --> 03:40.450
I wish Takkyun
and Makun to be in
love forever and ever

03:40.450 --> 03:42.110
I'm right here, aren't I?

03:42.110 --> 03:43.740
Just kill me!

03:43.740 --> 03:50.870
As the cold north winds strike the hearts of the forever alone, I can barely stand to watch!

03:50.870 --> 03:53.170
Quit worrying, Toi-san.

03:53.170 --> 03:56.670
At least <i>you</i> have a slim chance.

03:57.090 --> 03:57.960
Slim?

03:57.960 --> 04:00.380
I could potentially be the next shrine maiden.

04:00.380 --> 04:04.390
Even after I get a boyfriend,
it'll never be like the real thing.

04:04.390 --> 04:06.930
How sad. You're talking as
if you'll actually get one.

04:06.930 --> 04:08.220
Hey!

04:08.220 --> 04:10.020
What're you two babbling about during work!?

04:10.930 --> 04:12.850
I-I'm sorry!

04:12.850 --> 04:24.240
Good Luck Charms

04:13.270 --> 04:13.980
Just kiddin'.

04:13.980 --> 04:16.060
Oh, it's just your dad.

04:16.060 --> 04:18.020
Where are you going, Shingo?

04:18.020 --> 04:20.360
I thought you were off since yesterday was a night shift.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.280
They called me back in.

04:22.280 --> 04:24.240
Being a public servant's tough work.

04:24.860 --> 04:26.780
Sorry, Matoi.

04:27.120 --> 04:29.790
D-Don't worry, it's okay!

04:29.790 --> 04:31.750
J-Just do your best!

04:31.750 --> 04:32.870
Y-Yeah.

04:33.290 --> 04:35.750
See you later!

04:36.380 --> 04:39.050
Your dad's so cool, Toi-san.

04:39.050 --> 04:41.010
You think? He just seems like a slob to me.

04:41.420 --> 04:44.260
He used to be an investigator for the Tokyo Metropolitan Police, right?

04:44.630 --> 04:48.350
It's like that saying,
"Don't judge a book by its cover."

04:52.060 --> 04:54.000
Sorry for calling you back

04:54.000 --> 04:56.980
when you could've been enjoying your day off with your daughter, Shin.

04:56.980 --> 04:58.730
You making fun of me?

04:58.730 --> 04:59.400
Huh?

04:59.770 --> 05:01.190
Whatever, just drive.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.290
<i>It's been three months now
since we came to this city.</i>

05:10.830 --> 05:14.870
<i>The hectic days faded into quiet ones,
and my life became boring pretty quickly.</i>

05:15.290 --> 05:18.790
<i>But that's just the sort of life I've always wanted.</i>

05:19.900 --> 05:24.800
<i>What I didn't know was that these days were fleeting and fragile,</i>

05:24.800 --> 05:32.430
<i>and that we were in the center of a twisted world.</i>

05:37.810 --> 05:40.310
<i>I'm Possessed.</i>

05:42.320 --> 05:44.690
What do you think, girls? Ain't it a hit?

05:44.690 --> 05:47.660
I made the shrine more
welcoming to the god of love,

05:47.660 --> 05:52.630
then I gradually broke the news that
I'd be dressed like Cupid all over the net.

05:52.630 --> 05:54.160
That's amazing, Papa!

05:54.160 --> 05:56.160
Such bold commercial spirit!

05:56.160 --> 05:58.870
Bold enough to be punished
by the heavens, even.

05:58.870 --> 06:01.090
Ain't that right?

06:02.000 --> 06:02.710
Excuse me.

06:02.710 --> 06:07.800
Yes, of course! A picture with
Priest Cupid will be 2,000 yen—

06:11.470 --> 06:13.970
My name is Haruka Luciela.

06:13.970 --> 06:15.220
Where is the head priest of this—

06:15.220 --> 06:16.810
It's me!

06:16.810 --> 06:18.390
That's my papa!

06:18.390 --> 06:20.230
Always nice to the pretty ladies.

06:21.270 --> 06:24.030
The victim is one Endou Manami, age 23.

06:24.030 --> 06:26.530
She's with a specialized modeling agency for artists.

06:26.860 --> 06:29.260
The first report was by a worried coworker

06:29.260 --> 06:32.200
who noticed she hadn't returned from an appointment.

06:32.200 --> 06:36.200
She came searching and found
her here, weak and unconscious.

06:36.500 --> 06:39.870
Poochi, who owns this studio?

06:39.870 --> 06:42.340
Shimizu Sadamitsu, age 34.

06:42.340 --> 06:43.840
He works as a painter.

06:42.840 --> 06:42.920
Sadamitsu's
Scream Exhibit

06:43.840 --> 06:45.460
No family to speak of.

06:46.670 --> 06:48.050
Anyway...

06:49.970 --> 06:52.180
What the hell is all this?

07:28.510 --> 07:30.340
I see, I see.

07:30.340 --> 07:32.180
All the way from France? That's amazing!

07:32.180 --> 07:36.640
Now, what can my shrine and I do for you?

07:36.640 --> 07:41.100
I researched Japanese shrines and temples during my college years.

07:41.480 --> 07:43.190
In the course of my research,

07:43.190 --> 07:49.070
I happened across references to the priests of this shrine performing exorcisms long ago.

07:49.070 --> 07:50.860
That's what I've heard,

07:50.860 --> 07:54.200
and that it had been a tradition of ours dating back before the Edo period.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.910
The books I read

07:55.910 --> 08:00.500
mentioned that a sacred treasure used to perform these exorcisms was being guarded here.

08:00.500 --> 08:04.330
Would you be willing to show me this treasure?

08:05.290 --> 08:06.540
I'm not sure...

08:06.540 --> 08:07.840
That's not—

08:09.440 --> 08:11.130
Be my guest!

08:11.130 --> 08:13.200
Yay! I wanna see it too!

08:13.200 --> 08:14.430
Yuma-chan!

08:14.430 --> 08:19.140
I didn't know our shrine did exorcisms!

08:19.140 --> 08:20.840
You seem happy about it.

08:20.840 --> 08:21.850
Of course!

08:21.850 --> 08:27.570
After all, if priest families can do exorcisms, that means I can do them too!

08:27.570 --> 08:31.280
They're all like, "Demon, begone!" and stuff, right?

08:31.280 --> 08:33.990
It's like I'm a movie heroine! Isn't that cool!?

08:36.410 --> 08:39.120
I doubt we've truly done stuff that important.

08:39.120 --> 08:43.580
I'm sure there was some rumor that we exorcised a fox spirit or something that just stuck.

08:44.790 --> 08:47.420
Ah, that's the ticket!

08:49.550 --> 08:51.460
That's the sacred treasure?

08:51.460 --> 08:54.050
According to family legend it is, at least.

08:54.680 --> 08:56.090
Isn't it kinda shrimpy?

08:56.090 --> 08:58.430
Don't be so rude.

08:58.430 --> 09:00.260
Excuse me, may I take a...

09:00.260 --> 09:02.140
Go right ahead. I don't mind.

09:15.070 --> 09:16.610
Thank you very much.

09:18.530 --> 09:20.790
You're done with it then, I take it?

09:20.790 --> 09:22.700
Yes, that's all.

09:22.700 --> 09:24.870
Now it's my turn!

09:26.040 --> 09:27.630
Demons begone!

09:27.630 --> 09:30.420
Photogenic Plasma Illusion!

09:31.420 --> 09:33.630
How old are you again, Yuma-chan?

09:33.630 --> 09:37.090
I'm 13 and in my first year
of middle school. Why?

09:37.090 --> 09:38.590
Oh, no reason.

09:38.590 --> 09:40.390
C'mon, give it back.

09:40.970 --> 09:41.810
Yes.

09:41.810 --> 09:43.720
It was a dead end like we expected.

09:44.770 --> 09:47.020
There are concerns about Case 6?

09:47.020 --> 09:49.730
Understood. I'll head there immediately.

09:54.030 --> 09:55.740
With cumin the curry becomes quite fragrant!

09:54.570 --> 09:56.000
And a bit of subtle seasoning...

09:57.490 --> 09:59.280
I'm home!

09:59.280 --> 10:00.830
Welcome back!

10:01.330 --> 10:04.290
How was work, Shingo-san?

10:04.290 --> 10:06.960
Well, same old, I guess.

10:06.960 --> 10:11.460
I made your dinner extra spicy!
Just the way you like it!

10:11.460 --> 10:13.710
Looking forward to it.

10:14.260 --> 10:15.760
Thanks for the food.

10:18.840 --> 10:22.390
How is it? I made it just like the recipe said.

10:23.850 --> 10:25.060
Matoi,

10:25.060 --> 10:27.690
the most painful thing for a cop

10:27.690 --> 10:30.730
is having to explain a victim's cause of death to a bereaved family.

10:30.730 --> 10:33.690
Too many details will only worsen their grief,

10:33.690 --> 10:37.440
but it isn't right to bend the truth either.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.030
Out with it.

10:39.030 --> 10:40.660
You used too much cumin.

10:47.080 --> 10:49.540
The truth is bitter.

10:49.540 --> 10:51.130
Indeed it is.

10:56.880 --> 10:59.170
You don't have to force yourself to eat it!

10:59.630 --> 11:01.010
Sorry! I'm headed out.

11:01.010 --> 11:02.850
Be careful!

11:04.810 --> 11:06.310
No need to worry.

11:06.310 --> 11:08.600
I'm a coward.

11:12.100 --> 11:13.770
What happened, Poochi?

11:13.770 --> 11:16.480
Another woman has been found unconscious.

11:16.480 --> 11:17.900
Got it. I'm on my way.

11:22.160 --> 11:22.820
No!

11:23.200 --> 11:25.030
Stay away! Stay away!

11:25.030 --> 11:26.910
No!

11:31.960 --> 11:33.960
Find them.

11:35.000 --> 11:38.830
Kamaya City Bus

11:35.000 --> 11:38.830
Tenman Shrine

11:35.000 --> 11:38.830
Bus Stop

11:35.540 --> 11:38.840
So he's been at work since last night?

11:38.840 --> 11:42.470
I mean, he's probably just sleeping at the station.

11:42.470 --> 11:47.220
Toi-san, have you been anywhere with your dad since you moved here?

11:48.430 --> 11:50.390
Now that you mention it...

11:51.310 --> 11:51.390
Kamaya City Transportation

11:52.020 --> 11:53.560
I don't think so.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.900
Let's all practice
safe driving for Safety
Awareness Month!

11:53.560 --> 11:55.900
Safety starts in your
heart and your planning!

11:53.560 --> 11:55.900
Kamaya City Police Station

11:55.900 --> 11:58.100
It's the same case as last time.

11:55.900 --> 11:57.830
Violent Crimes Division

11:58.100 --> 11:59.410
Tomoda Keiko,

11:59.410 --> 12:03.110
the second victim, was found terribly weak,
unconscious and in critical condition.

12:03.110 --> 12:06.860
So neither victim was held in sustained captivity

12:03.110 --> 12:09.330
Suspect

12:03.110 --> 12:09.330
1st Victim

12:03.110 --> 12:09.330
2nd Victim

12:06.860 --> 12:09.330
and there's no evidence that drugs were used on them.

12:09.330 --> 12:12.790
Just what did that bastard Shimuzu do to them?

12:12.790 --> 12:14.580
I've read the file.

12:14.970 --> 12:17.920
I can already tell you that
the victims' debilitated state

12:17.920 --> 12:21.340
bears a strong resemblance to a string of deaths in Holland two years ago.

12:21.340 --> 12:22.460
A blondie!

12:22.880 --> 12:23.970
Who are you?

12:23.970 --> 12:29.650
Haruka Luciela, IATO, Department of
Anomalous Crimes, Chemistry Division.

12:29.650 --> 12:31.260
Anomalous Crimes...

12:31.260 --> 12:33.350
What's that? I've never heard of you.

12:33.350 --> 12:35.650
Head Office requested her.

12:35.650 --> 12:39.440
I won't tell you to get along,
but don't go gettin' me into trouble.

12:39.440 --> 12:41.320
I look forward to working with you.

12:41.320 --> 12:44.860
I'm Tezuka Hideo, head patrol officer of the Violent Crimes Division.

12:44.860 --> 12:46.700
Just call me Poochi.

12:46.700 --> 12:47.410
Why?

12:47.410 --> 12:49.620
Because he's a helpless little bitch!

12:49.620 --> 12:52.620
You said there was a similar case in Holland.

12:52.620 --> 12:55.040
What made the victims so weak?

12:55.040 --> 12:58.120
You've got yourself a fancy title and the research to back all this up.

12:58.120 --> 13:01.500
Surely there's a logical explanation for all this.

13:02.550 --> 13:04.420
Allow me to explain.

13:05.130 --> 13:06.800
The reason...

13:07.350 --> 13:10.510
the victims are found weak in both this case and the last

13:11.390 --> 13:13.350
is Plasma.

13:13.350 --> 13:13.890
Pla...

13:14.470 --> 13:15.310
...sma?

13:15.310 --> 13:16.430
Plasma.

13:19.190 --> 13:20.440
Poochi.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.190
This woman's dangerous.

13:22.190 --> 13:23.280
Yes!

13:23.280 --> 13:25.400
In more ways than one!

13:27.690 --> 13:29.240
That was delicious!

13:30.030 --> 13:32.330
I need to thank your mom, Yuma-chan.

13:32.330 --> 13:35.080
She told me she doesn't mind packing you food because she knows

13:35.080 --> 13:37.620
that you'll eat it all
no matter how much she packs.

13:38.000 --> 13:40.460
Hey, don't turn me into a glutton character!

13:40.460 --> 13:42.090
Anyways...

13:42.540 --> 13:43.800
Ta-da!

13:43.800 --> 13:45.050
That's...

13:45.050 --> 13:49.220
Yes! I finally found it in the shrine's storehouse!

13:49.220 --> 13:51.430
You seriously brought that to school?

13:52.180 --> 13:56.200
It's proof my family <i>did</i> do exorcisms.

13:56.200 --> 13:58.270
"The Rite of Divine Possession?"

13:58.270 --> 14:03.560
I bet doing this ritual will give us transcendent exorcist powers or something!

14:03.560 --> 14:05.900
O-Oh, really? How cool.

14:06.400 --> 14:08.070
Why aren't you more excited?

14:08.070 --> 14:09.820
You're gonna do this with me too!

14:11.070 --> 14:12.160
Yes.

14:22.670 --> 14:25.420
Just as I thought, the DR's residual reaction is—

14:27.840 --> 14:29.830
What was that Plasma stuff you were going on about?

14:29.830 --> 14:31.010
Buncha hot air.

14:31.410 --> 14:32.840
Sergeant Sumeragi.

14:32.840 --> 14:37.270
I'm sure you planned on investigating alone, but it won't be that easy.

14:37.270 --> 14:41.100
And <i>I</i> want to solve this damn case and go home already.

14:41.440 --> 14:44.480
So, be it the occult or whatever, I'll use any method I can.

14:44.940 --> 14:46.940
So tell me, what have you discovered?

14:46.940 --> 14:48.360
I have a question first.

14:48.860 --> 14:49.940
I'm the one asking the questions—

14:49.940 --> 14:51.820
In the areas where the victims were found,

14:51.820 --> 14:54.870
are there any buildings still standing that date back to the 15th century?

14:54.870 --> 14:56.120
The 15th century?

14:56.120 --> 14:57.120
This is important!

14:58.080 --> 15:01.710
I've only been here for three months—

15:01.710 --> 15:06.500
Wait, the shrine that has helped us so much <i>is</i> pretty old.

15:06.500 --> 15:07.700
What's the shrine's name?

15:07.700 --> 15:09.010
Tenman Shrine.

15:09.760 --> 15:11.050
It can't be!

15:11.050 --> 15:11.840
Hey!

15:12.430 --> 15:14.340
I'm taking it!

15:14.340 --> 15:15.600
Say Cupid!

15:17.220 --> 15:19.140
Thank you so much!

15:20.060 --> 15:21.600
Congratulations!

15:21.600 --> 15:24.900
Now your love will be eternal! Probably!

15:25.650 --> 15:28.480
Shimizu is coming to Tenman Shrine?

15:28.480 --> 15:29.980
What do you mean?

15:33.490 --> 15:35.410
It's just a hunch!

15:37.120 --> 15:38.660
But those weren't...

15:41.620 --> 15:44.620
Toi-san, let's do the ritual together!

15:44.620 --> 15:46.830
Why's it gotta be me?

15:46.830 --> 15:48.270
Hey, Toi-san!

15:48.270 --> 15:49.800
Sorry, Yuma-chan! See you tomorrow—

15:49.800 --> 15:51.880
I'll buy you a fruit sundae from Meikadou!

15:53.420 --> 15:57.470
A slave to your desires, huh?
I don't dislike that.

16:00.220 --> 16:02.100
No, but—

16:04.640 --> 16:06.310
Are you serious!? Holy shit!

16:06.310 --> 16:07.610
Wait up, Makun!

16:07.610 --> 16:08.770
Run faster!

16:08.770 --> 16:10.570
Someone call the police!

16:12.570 --> 16:13.690
What's going on?

16:26.790 --> 16:27.460
Over there!

16:29.250 --> 16:30.800
Just floor it!

16:31.090 --> 16:31.840
Papa!

16:31.840 --> 16:33.130
Kusa-san!

16:33.130 --> 16:35.000
Papa! Mama! Hang on!

16:36.340 --> 16:38.140
What happened to them?

16:49.940 --> 16:51.230
It's coming this way!

16:51.230 --> 16:52.780
N-No way...

16:53.650 --> 16:54.940
Somebody...

17:13.590 --> 17:15.290
Poochi, it's me.

17:15.290 --> 17:16.340
Shingo-san!

17:15.630 --> 17:16.340
Sumeragi-san!

17:16.340 --> 17:18.680
I've detained the suspect.

17:19.260 --> 17:21.470
Yeah. Right away.

17:23.060 --> 17:24.020
He's—

17:39.320 --> 17:40.540
Shingo-san!

17:53.840 --> 17:55.340
Hold it right there!

17:55.340 --> 17:56.510
Yuma-chan!

17:56.510 --> 17:59.630
You won't get away with wrecking my home!

17:59.630 --> 18:01.430
Stop it, Yuma-chan!

18:01.430 --> 18:05.970
I'll show you the exorcising power of the Tenman Shrine!

18:05.970 --> 18:08.980
How'd it go again? Uh...

18:08.980 --> 18:11.400
Quit being stupid, Yuma-chan! Run!

18:12.770 --> 18:13.770
<i>Why?</i>

18:14.570 --> 18:16.230
<i>How did this happen?</i>

18:18.030 --> 18:21.570
<i>I don't want to be special.</i>

18:22.200 --> 18:23.700
<i>Just let me be ordinary.</i>

18:24.580 --> 18:26.040
<i>Just let me be normal.</i>

18:39.300 --> 18:40.380
<i>What's that?</i>

18:41.470 --> 18:44.800
Wow, the ritual worked!

18:45.350 --> 18:48.680
Now, come to me!
My demon banishing powers!

18:51.480 --> 18:52.690
It ignored me!?

19:07.830 --> 19:09.790
Found you!

19:10.750 --> 19:12.670
I'm in big trouble!

19:16.340 --> 19:17.750
You ignore me too!?

19:19.420 --> 19:20.510
Toi-san!

19:32.060 --> 19:34.020
Ow, ow, ow...

19:39.070 --> 19:40.070
Toi-san!

19:40.690 --> 19:43.450
That's amazing! You're an exorcist girl!

19:43.450 --> 19:44.200
Huh?

19:45.280 --> 19:46.030
What?

19:46.280 --> 19:48.990
M...Mom?

19:48.990 --> 19:51.250
No... is this me?

19:51.250 --> 19:52.960
What's going on?

19:56.000 --> 19:57.670
Give it to me.

19:57.670 --> 19:58.460
What?

19:58.460 --> 20:03.380
Give it to me!

20:07.530 --> 20:12.310
Nooooooooooooo!

20:59.520 --> 21:00.770
<i>That costume...</i>

21:02.110 --> 21:03.280
<i>Is she Fatima?</i>

21:04.280 --> 21:07.000
<i>No, her pattern of Divine Union is different.</i>

21:07.660 --> 21:09.000
<i>Who on earth is she?</i>

21:10.950 --> 21:12.700
I...

21:12.700 --> 21:13.910
Shiori?

21:15.750 --> 21:18.400
You've come back to me, Shiori!

21:19.080 --> 21:20.670
I always knew you would!

21:22.420 --> 21:24.710
I... believed in you!

21:26.470 --> 21:29.010
N-No!

21:31.430 --> 21:32.760
<i>And so...</i>

21:33.720 --> 21:38.060
<i>my fleeting, fragile, quiet ordinary life...</i>

21:40.150 --> 21:42.980
<i>completely crumbled away.</i>

21:43.650 --> 21:45.810
Feeling your heart

21:45.810 --> 21:54.570
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

21:45.810 --> 21:54.570
It's natural for us all to be followed

21:54.570 --> 22:00.580
matoi tsuzukeru

21:54.570 --> 22:00.580
by light and shadow

22:00.580 --> 22:04.080
The lonely one

22:06.250 --> 22:08.290
Feeling your heart

22:08.290 --> 22:17.010
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:08.340 --> 22:17.050
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

22:17.010 --> 22:23.270
sore ga shiawase nano

22:17.010 --> 22:23.270
But is that truly happiness?

22:23.270 --> 22:28.230
darekaga egao nara

22:23.270 --> 22:28.230
If someone is smiling,

22:28.230 --> 22:34.740
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

22:28.230 --> 22:34.740
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

22:34.740 --> 22:40.950
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

22:34.740 --> 22:40.950
As our paths continue to cross,

22:40.950 --> 22:45.750
kimochi ga aru

22:40.950 --> 22:45.750
our love grows stronger

22:45.750 --> 22:50.750
hitotoki no aida ni

22:45.750 --> 22:50.750
In that short span of time

22:50.750 --> 22:57.260
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

22:50.750 --> 22:57.260
we embrace all contradictions

22:57.260 --> 23:05.390
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

22:57.300 --> 23:05.440
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:05.390 --> 23:10.570
aruiteku no kana

23:05.390 --> 23:10.570
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:13.910 --> 23:15.410
What do I do?

23:15.410 --> 23:17.080
What should I do?

23:17.450 --> 23:21.830
I can't go home like this!

23:21.830 --> 23:23.330
Turn me back!

23:23.330 --> 23:24.420
Someone, please!

23:24.920 --> 23:27.800
Just turn me back into
the ordinary Sumeragi Matoi!

23:37.140 --> 23:40.850
I-I'm back. Thank God!

23:42.780 --> 23:46.480
Wh-Why am I naked!?

23:47.020 --> 23:48.940
<i>Oh, God.</i>

23:48.940 --> 23:49.980
<i>I'm...</i>

23:50.610 --> 23:53.610
<i>not ordinary at all!</i>

23:56.990 --> 24:02.500
My dream is to live with my parents like a normal girl, even if it's boring.

24:00.980 --> 24:01.690
Eradicate spirits

24:01.070 --> 24:01.690
Eradicate
spirits

24:02.500 --> 24:05.210
And someday, to be a wonderful bride.

24:06.000 --> 24:10.970
Episode 2

24:06.000 --> 24:10.970
I Clad Myself in a God

24:06.160 --> 24:08.680
Next time,
"I Clad Myself in a God."

24:08.680 --> 24:10.400
Yes! There goes my dream!
